{"title":"同比增长4.8%！全国建筑业总产值138312亿元！国家统计局公布上半年国民经济相关数据！","date":"2024-07-16","content":"<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10.5pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:21.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:\r\n18.0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">同比增长<span lang=\"EN-US\">4.8%</span>！全国建筑业总产值<span lang=\"EN-US\">138312</span>亿元！</span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10.5pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:21.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:\r\n18.0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">国家统计局公布上半年国民经济相关数据！</span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:21.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:\r\n.4pt;mso-font-kerning:18.0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">7</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">月<span lang=\"EN-US\">15</span>日，国家统计局公布了今年上半年全国经济运行情况。经初步核算，<span lang=\"EN-US\">2024</span>年上半年国内生产总值<span lang=\"EN-US\">616836</span>亿元，同比增长<span lang=\"EN-US\">5.0%</span>。上半年建筑业总产值<span lang=\"EN-US\">138312</span>亿元，同比增长<span lang=\"EN-US\">4.8%</span>。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;line-height:normal;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">重大项目带动作用凸显<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span>固定资产投资稳定增长<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:18.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:\r\nnone\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:normal;\r\nmso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt;\r\nmso-ligatures:none\">2024</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">年<span lang=\"EN-US\">1&mdash;6</span>月份，全国固定资产投资（不含农户）<span lang=\"EN-US\">245391</span>亿元，同比增长<span lang=\"EN-US\">3.9%</span>。其中，民间固定资产投资<span lang=\"EN-US\">127278</span>亿元，同比增长<span lang=\"EN-US\">0.1%</span>。从环比看，<span lang=\"EN-US\">6</span>月份固定资产投资（不含农户）增长<span lang=\"EN-US\">0.21%</span>。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:\r\nnone\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:normal;\r\nmso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">今年以来，各地区积极推进增发国债项目开工建设，加快推进灾后恢复重建项目，基础设施投资保持平稳增长。上半年，基础设施投资同比增长<span lang=\"EN-US\">5.4%</span>，增速比全部投资高<span lang=\"EN-US\">1.5</span>个百分点，拉动全部投资增长<span lang=\"EN-US\">1.2</span>个百分点。目前，<span lang=\"EN-US\">2023</span>年增发国债<span lang=\"EN-US\">1.5</span>万个项目已经全部开工建设。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:normal;\r\nmso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">同时，<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>两重<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>项目加快下达、重大项目建设提速也有利于带动投资增长。上半年，计划总投资亿元及以上项目投资同比增长<span lang=\"EN-US\">8.4%</span>，增速比全部投资高<span lang=\"EN-US\">4.5</span>个百分点，拉动全部投资增长<span lang=\"EN-US\">4.5</span>个百分点。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:\r\nnone\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;line-height:normal;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:center;\r\nline-height:normal;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none;mso-no-proof:yes\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202407/Q1.png\" style=\"width: 1080px; height: 542px;\" /></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;line-height:normal;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0cm\" type=\"disc\">\r\n\t<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\n     inter-ideograph;line-height:normal;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:\r\n     l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\">\r\n\t\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:\r\n     16.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt;\r\n     mso-ligatures:none\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\r\n     mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">分产业看，第一产业投资<span lang=\"EN-US\">4540</span>亿元，同比增长<span lang=\"EN-US\">3.1%</span>；第二产业投资<span lang=\"EN-US\">82297</span>亿元，增长<span lang=\"EN-US\">12.6%</span>；第三产业投资<span lang=\"EN-US\">158554</span>亿元，下降<span lang=\"EN-US\">0.2%</span>。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0cm\" type=\"disc\">\r\n\t<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\n     inter-ideograph;line-height:normal;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:\r\n     l3 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\">\r\n\t\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:\r\n     16.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt;\r\n     mso-ligatures:none\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\r\n     mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">第二产业中，工业投资同比增长<span lang=\"EN-US\">12.6%</span>。其中，采矿业投资增长<span lang=\"EN-US\">17.0%</span>，制造业投资增长<span lang=\"EN-US\">9.5%</span>，电力、热力、燃气及水生产和供应业投资增长<span lang=\"EN-US\">24.2%</span>。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0cm\" type=\"disc\">\r\n\t<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\n     inter-ideograph;line-height:normal;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:\r\n     l2 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\">\r\n\t\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:\r\n     16.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt;\r\n     mso-ligatures:none\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\r\n     mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">第三产业中，基础设施投资（不含电力、热力、燃气及水生产和供应业）同比增长<span lang=\"EN-US\">5.4%</span>。其中，水利管理业投资增长<span lang=\"EN-US\">27.4%</span>，航空运输业投资增长<span lang=\"EN-US\">23.7%</span>，铁路运输业投资增长<span lang=\"EN-US\">18.5%</span>。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0cm\" type=\"disc\">\r\n\t<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\n     inter-ideograph;line-height:normal;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:\r\n     l0 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\">\r\n\t\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:\r\n     16.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt;\r\n     mso-ligatures:none\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\r\n     mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">分地区看，东部地区投资同比增长<span lang=\"EN-US\">3.8%</span>，中部地区投资增长<span lang=\"EN-US\">4.0%</span>，西部地区投资增长<span lang=\"EN-US\">1.0%</span>，东北地区投资增长<span lang=\"EN-US\">3.4%</span>。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0cm\" type=\"disc\">\r\n\t<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\n     inter-ideograph;line-height:normal;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:\r\n     l4 level1 lfo5;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\">\r\n\t\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:\r\n     16.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt;\r\n     mso-ligatures:none\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\r\n     mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">分登记注册类型看，内资企业投资同比增长<span lang=\"EN-US\">3.8%</span>，港澳台企业投资增长<span lang=\"EN-US\">5.1%</span>，外商企业投资下降<span lang=\"EN-US\">15.8%</span>。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;line-height:normal;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;line-height:normal;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:center;\r\nline-height:normal;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:\r\nnone\">全国建筑业房屋建筑施工面积下降<span lang=\"EN-US\">6.2% </span>房地产市场处在调整转型过程中</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:18.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:normal;\r\nmso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt;\r\nmso-ligatures:none\">2024</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">年上半年全国建筑业房屋建筑施工面积<span lang=\"EN-US\">110.4</span>亿平方米，同比下降<span lang=\"EN-US\">6.2%</span>。全国房地产开发投资<span lang=\"EN-US\">52529</span>亿元，同比下降<span lang=\"EN-US\">10.1%</span>。其中，房地产开发企业房屋施工面积<span lang=\"EN-US\">696818</span>万平方米，同比下降<span lang=\"EN-US\">12.0%</span>。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;line-height:normal;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:center;\r\nline-height:normal;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none;mso-no-proof:yes\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202407/Q2.jpg\" style=\"width: 648px; height: 219px;\" /></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;line-height:normal;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:center;\r\nline-height:normal;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none;mso-no-proof:yes\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202407/Q3.png\" style=\"width: 1668px; height: 1098px;\" /></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;line-height:normal;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:normal;\r\nmso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">上半年，全国新建商品房销售面积、销售额同比分别下降<span lang=\"EN-US\">19.0%</span>、<span lang=\"EN-US\">25.0%</span>，降幅比<span lang=\"EN-US\">1&mdash;5</span>月份收窄<span lang=\"EN-US\">1.3</span>、<span lang=\"EN-US\">2.9</span>个百分点；房屋新开工面积、房地产开发企业到位资金降幅也有所收窄。从住建等相关部门了解的情况看，近几个月二手房网签面积同比也有所增长，一线城市<span lang=\"EN-US\">6</span>月份成交面积环比增长较快。同时，保障性住房建设、<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>平急两用<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>公共基础设施建设、城中村改造等<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>三大工程<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>积极推进，有利于构建房地产市场发展新模式，也为投资扩张增添了动力。上半年，房地产<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>三大工程<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>拉动房地产开发投资<span lang=\"EN-US\">0.9</span>个百分点。目前房地产相关指标仍在下降，房地产市场仍处在调整转型过程中。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:15.0pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:normal;\r\nmso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">据相关负责人表示，尽管国内外环境复杂多变，但我国经济运行总体平稳，既有量的增长，更有质的提升。下阶段，将更好统筹稳增长和增后劲，统筹扩大内需和深化供给侧结构性改革，统筹发展和安全，进一步实施好宏观政策，精准发力、持续用力、形成合力，促进经济持续健康发展。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>"}